{"h":11508,"w":7029,"lines":[{"conf":1,"x":0.12094947299914209,"w":0.82217139702338682,"h":0.026406524673340814,"text":"for when I am weak, then I am strong\" (2 Cor. 12: 8-10).","y":0.92717770513250686},{"y":0.90697674436851217,"text":"Here we see at work the freedom of him who, as a new man","x":0.12351544244353861,"w":0.81472684191418931,"conf":1,"h":0.020354604910290397},{"w":0.81710211023107748,"text":"in Christ, no more belongs to this old world which passes","y":0.88368055569606985,"x":0.12114016311486489,"h":0.021842700148385741,"conf":1},{"x":0.12114015605620546,"text":"away. Here we see manifested freedom from fear and dismay","conf":1,"y":0.86185515826043946,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.020412283284323651},{"text":"through the fullness of self-surrender to God. Have we got so","y":0.83854166658832585,"conf":1,"w":0.81710211023107759,"x":0.12114014826925955,"h":0.020585317460317443},{"w":0.82185269640637681,"text":"far? Oh that we might reach this stage of Christian devotion!","y":0.81686046563083514,"h":0.021802325097341368,"x":0.11876487198683507,"conf":1},{"x":0.12114016424336731,"w":0.82185269640637693,"y":0.7936046513113415,"h":0.02038344409730708,"text":"And if we do not dare to join in the triumphant words of","conf":1},{"h":0.022343241979205342,"text":"Paul, then let us echo from our hearts the plain words of","y":0.77018451060690585,"x":0.12107050041184839,"w":0.82202539815531139,"conf":1},{"w":0.26365795383205665,"text":"Matthias Claudius:","x":0.1211401423408431,"h":0.015988372621082103,"y":0.74999999966329622,"conf":1},{"text":"\"Lord, grant us to behold Thy majesty","x":0.21140142042210844,"y":0.71220930269015426,"w":0.53919239787312301,"h":0.023255813689458948,"conf":1},{"x":0.2276780971592138,"w":0.60177478542575591,"conf":1,"y":0.68878712961126665,"h":0.025302881286257795,"text":"And trust not in the world that fades away,"},{"y":0.66715116288837639,"conf":1,"x":0.22802850653232315,"h":0.020348837451329427,"text":"Nor boast ourselves on earth of vanity:","w":0.53444181169782357},{"conf":1,"y":0.64533730185983051,"x":0.23040380372475733,"w":0.61757719361936891,"h":0.02182539682539697,"text":"Make us and keep us pure in heart, we pray."},{"h":0.021906145981379854,"conf":1,"text":"Like joyous children may we be,","x":0.29216152409427409,"y":0.62053571396918028,"w":0.44418052574256794},{"text":"Walking Thy ways, our hope in Thee!\"","conf":1,"y":0.5988372093626666,"h":0.021802325097341368,"w":0.54631830190683339,"x":0.29216151405054214},{"h":0.011627906844729474,"y":0.072674418732950996,"x":0.49881235297177251,"w":0.047505936065277532,"text":"200","conf":1}],"page":196}